{% macro content(spec) %}
{% set spec = spec or {} %}
{% set _class = spec.class or '' %}
{% set _content = spec.content or '{}' %}
{% block config %}
  {# Correct base url pathing for this page #}
  {% set baseUrl = '../' %}
{% endblock %}
<!--Experience Row Quizrr Design Lead-->
<div class="row">
  <div class="col m8 s12">
    <h3>Design Lead - <a href="https://www.quizrr.se/" target="_blank">Quizrr AB</a></h3>
  </div>
  <div class="col m4 s12">
    <h3 class="right-title">2024 / 09 - Current</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <p class="col m12">
      At Quizrr I’ve been leading the Design strategy, culture and ways of working, leading designers, including a senior designer, and three teams, reshaping our worker training ecosystem, consisting of a Dashboard and eLearning SaaS. With an emphasis on driving AI-native workflows to do more with less, I've managed to help us scale our user expertise at quality.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col m12">
      <h4 class="sub-title">Key Responsibilities</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Design Leadership
        </li>
        <li>
          Design Strategy
        </li>
        <li>
          Design Operations
        </li>
        <li>
          AI Best practices and workflows
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col m12">
      <h4 class="sub-title">Key Achievements</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Established the design direction, process and principles, leading to a reduction in design debt by 50%, and enabling discovery workflows, allowing for rapid explorations which increased the delivery speed of new user experienced by 2x.</li>
        <li>Led the end-to-end user experience for Quizrr’s global SaaS eLearning platform on app and web, from discovery to delivery, raising the design maturity improving our user onboarding and adoption rates by 10% year-on-year.</li>
        <li>Established AI-native workflows, including design guidelines, user research and component libraries, enabling non-developers to contribute to feature delivery.</li>
        <li>Implemented a design system from the ground up to cover massive SaaS Learning Management System, connecting it with code and accessibility standards</li>
        <li>Advanced prototyping capabilities using Figma and AI-coding agents for rapid iteration and testing.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<!--Experience Row HM Product Designer-->
<div class="row">
  <div class="col m8 s12">
