      At H&amp;M I’ve held a range of responsibilities, from working on app features centred around fashion style and customer activation, guiding the end-to-end design process, to leading the UX revamp of the global Web Experience. I was also deeply involved in numerous design process initiatives from the Accessibility and AIxDesign groups, to supporting the Design System and Design Ops teams.
