        <li>Lead the global UX revamp of the web experience, aligning dozens of teams around Web &amp; Desktop redesigns, providing coordination of usability studies and implementation, leading to an increase of 27% in sessions moving onto other pages, and a drop of 11% in single-page sessions on the index page.</li>
        <li>Lead the ideation-to-prototype for a Digital Close feature for app and webb at record speed for the company, with a time to market under 6 months and learnings at low risk.</li>
        <li>Co-founding the Design AI Circle and driving AI usage in design processes such as research summaries.</li>
        <li>Revamped and improved the Digital Stylist project in the app, reaching 200% more activations.</li>
